window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>Welcome, players, to Celestia!</i></b></p> <p>Kaleb wakes up in a mysterious world of magic and monsters with a new tattoo he doesn't remember getting. A sadistic and wisecracking system tells him that he's one of 10,000 people who have been transported to Celestia. The catch? They each have a piece of a map on their skin, and some compelling people are vying to collect those pieces. He'll face monsters and cultists alike as he fights for his right to not be skinned alive in a world full of people who desperately want to do just that. The only way to ensure his safety is to gain power.</p> <p><i>Good luck out there, players. We hope you enjoy your stay in the idyllic and welcoming world of Celestia</i>.</p> <p><i>The map is on your skin, and the hunt is on!</i> Soul Shot Skirmisher <i>is a LitRPG with an original character class.</i></p>"; 
